{"v":4,"catch":"“Windmill Engine”是一款增量遊戲，您需要在其中以卡通風格的圖形構建風車結構。","desc":"- 按“Y”按鈕賺取您的第一筆錢。\n- 通過購買風車引擎的新元素（如帆、鐵軌、輪子）來增加收入。\n- 使用磨石升級所有引擎部件。\n- 油會減少您的引擎階段，您的風車每秒會賺更多的錢。\n- 學習新技術來開設磨坊、油廠和糖廠。\n- 當心故障！ 故障每秒鐘都會減少您的收入。\n建造一個完整的風車引擎並賺取 10 億美元！","publisher":"RandomSpin Games","release":"2022-09-08","genres":["益智","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/24ffecea8b5dbef14e3e5b9c9e68d21de6968e2b5f2ade8817408b081aee50e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6a5e60e9c42d5cf91b1bb2ee9d7b3a2ae4f86699d31345ae257c4875e5a5b9af.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8a348cc96095e0311328b6c01a05560d7d80892b731eca7822ab60a20535ecbe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c45484b8fba720c6f9c6673c5fb3c655aac1b6c2a5d0d1dc7d5a4cd6c6a45eb3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4178889745bab98005efa6275748377661913f534479f9f90b60f47195a6b1da.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d3c019616000","dlc":[]}